@* EXPERIENCE.md, State Patterns — "Not found." with a link to the parent list. Presentational:
   parameters in, nothing else.

   The name is NotFoundNotice rather than NotFound so it cannot collide with the <NotFound>
   parameter tag inside <Router>, which App.razor hands this component to.

   The h1 is what App.razor's <FocusOnNavigate Selector="h1" /> moves focus to on an unmatched
   route. Story 2.2 also gives it a second caller: Meeting Detail renders it bare when the API
   answers 404, which is what its /meetings + Voice.Meetings defaults are sized for. *@
<MudText Typo="Typo.h4" HtmlTag="h1" GutterBottom="true">@Voice.NotFound</MudText>

<MudLink Href="@ParentHref">@ParentLabel</MudLink>

@code {
    /// <summary>The parent list to offer. Meetings is the app's home destination.</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public string ParentHref { get; set; } = "/meetings";

    /// <summary>The link's text. Drawn from <c>Voice</c> so the copy stays in one vocabulary.</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public string ParentLabel { get; set; } = Voice.Meetings;
}
